###  Configure all three machines

Run these commands on every machine.

##Update packages
sudo apt update
sudo apt upgrade -y

Set hostnames

On Master:
sudo hostnamectl set-hostname kube-master

On Worker 1:
sudo hostnamectl set-hostname kube-worker1

On Worker 2:
sudo hostnamectl set-hostname kube-worker2

Reconnect to the machines.

Verify:
hostname
